OL,3,ANew UK-EU treaty has 10-year           
OL,4,Atermination clause                     
OL,6,FThe government and the EU have         
OL,7,Fpublished the texts of two treaties    
OL,8,Fagreed last week as part of a          
OL,9,Fpost-Brexit reset.                     
OL,11,FThe treaties were published on Thursday
OL,12,Fafternoon, alongside legislation       
OL,13,Fdesigned to enact the bulk of the deal.
OL,15,FThe deal covering food exports has a   
OL,16,F10-year termination clause that would  
OL,17,Fmean if one party ended the agreement, 
OL,18,Fthey would have to pay "reasonable and 
OL,19,Fproportionate costs" to rebuild border 
OL,20,Fchecks infrastructure, which will be   
OL,21,Fsignificantly scaled back as part of   
OL,22,Fthe new deal.                          
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
