OL,3,ANew UK-EU treaty has 10-year           
OL,4,Atermination clause                     
OL,6,FOpposition leader Kemi Badenoch has    
OL,7,Fsaid she would scrap the deal while    
OL,8,FReform UK's Nigel Farage has suggested 
OL,9,Fhe would refuse to pay.                
